{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "kind": "equipment_spec",
  "note": "设备类型库（G2）。现状 fleet_spec 只有一个 AMR-250 且 sim_engine 硬编码 models[0]；R3 才接引擎。这里先把【类型 + 时间模型 + AST → 巷道宽】的口径固定下来，数值带 source/level；资料未覆盖的标 gap。",
  "meta": {
    "sources": [
      {
        "param": "叉车 AST/速度/载荷",
        "value": "3400mm / 5.0m/s / 2000kg",
        "source": "M4:333-340,218",
        "level": "typical"
      },
      {
        "param": "堆垛机单/复合作业",
        "value": "65s / 120s / 150托每小时",
        "source": "F3:240-250",
        "level": "typical"
      },
      {
        "param": "巷道数余量 / 设备能力余量",
        "value": 1.2,
        "source": "起升设备参考:501；输送分拣参考:422,517",
        "level": "typical"
      }
    ]
  },
  "defaults": {
    "time_factor": 1.0,
    "pick_place_s": 12.0,
    "availability_factor": 0.85,
    "level": "assumption"
  },
  "time_model": {
    "stacker": {
      "single": "D/v + H/vv + tp*tf",
      "composite": "0.6*(D/v + H/vv) + 2*tp*tf"
    },
    "forklift": {
      "single": "2*(D/v) + tp*tf",
      "composite": "1.5*(D/v) + 2*tp*tf"
    },
    "height_check": "all_types",
    "load_rate_divisor": 2,
    "distance_factor_power": 1,
    "note": "B1/B2/B3 的修正写在这里：负荷率分母 ×2（1 复合 = 1 存 + 1 取）；叉车行走时间不再二次乘距离系数（资料原式 (D̄/v)·d_f 且 D̄ 已含 d_f，实际成了 d_f²）；高度检查对所有设备类型生效（资料只在叉车分支查，堆垛机漏检）。"
  },
  "ast_drives_aisle_width": false,
  "aisle_width_rule": {
    "formula": "aisle_width = max(layout_min_aisle, ast_mm/1000 + clearance)",
    "clearance": 0.2,
    "note": "默认 false（D5）：默认布局不读 AST，改动不会波及金标准。启用由 level/scenario 的 options.ast_drives_aisle_width 显式声明，并且**只对该区域的货架组生效**——组里必须声明 equipment_type。推出宽度低于通道下限会被夹紧并记 clamped=true；若全局没有任何组声明 equipment_type，spec_layout 直接报错（否则开关开了也无效）。见 ADR-REFACTOR-07。",
    "level": "assumption",
    "enabled_by": "level_or_scenario_only",
    "applies_to": "rack_groups_with_equipment_type"
  },
  "types": {
